<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan BSPA to tender for 54,000 tonnes US soy.</title>
<headline>Taiwan BSPA to tender for 54,000 tonnes US soy.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kaohsiung division of Taiwan's Breakfast Soybean Procurement Association will tender on Friday for a 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. soybeans, Taiwan traders said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The association's Kaohsiung division comprises Great Wall Enterprise, Ttet Union, Prisedent Enterprise and Tai Hwa Oil.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p> Type	Tonnes   Date/Location</p>
<p>			  U.S. Gulf	   Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Soybean   54,000   Feb 26-March 12   March 13-27</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
